WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.119
Today we will strengthen performance through reflection. Our work connects with other

00:00:05.119 --> 00:00:05.939
Ghanaian communities.

00:00:06.783 --> 00:00:10.175
Identify one timing or storytelling issue from feedback.

00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:13.231
Rehearse a concrete change as a group.

00:00:15.033 --> 00:00:19.540
Restage the piece and explain the difference between the two versions. Compare your

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:21.967
result with a second example from Ghana.
